        "text_VdJhRh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>There is a moment when a room stops feeling like a collection of furniture and starts feeling like yours. Sometimes it is a cushion that finally gets the colour right. Sometimes it is a floor lamp that makes the corner of the living room somewhere you actually want to sit. Sometimes it is a mirror that catches the afternoon light and makes the whole space feel bigger and calmer.<br/><br/>Shopica stocks cushions in linen, velvet and textured fabrics that suit coastal, Hamptons and contemporary Australian interiors. Floor lamps and table lamps that add warmth to rooms that deserve better than a single overhead globe. Mirrors that do real work on any wall. Throws, vases and candle holders that bring a room to life without a renovation budget.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_size": 3
          }
        },
