        "accent": "WHY SHOPICA?",
        "heading": "Quality You Can Trust",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "heading_font_size": 6,
        "text": "<p>Shopica is a Sydney-based, family-owned homeware, décor and furniture store founded by Eliane El Khoury. What started as a passion for beautiful, considered interiors has grown into a trusted destination for Australians who care about how their home looks and feels. We curate cushions, floor lamps, mirrors, bedside tables, dining tables, outdoor furniture and decorative pieces chosen specifically for Australian homes. Every piece is held to the same standard we would demand for our own. We do not stock products simply because they are popular. We stock them because they are well made, beautifully designed and worth every dollar.<br/><br/>Our Sydney-based team understands how Australian homes are lived in. The open plan living and dining spaces that define modern Australian architecture. The need for furniture that is beautiful on the weekend and durable through the week. The importance of getting the details right, from the cushion on the sofa to the lamp beside the bed. We source every product with all of this in mind.<br/><br/>With Australia-wide delivery, orders generally dispatched within 1–3 business days from our Sydney warehouse, and personal customer support from a team that genuinely cares about your home, Shopica is here to help you create a space that feels as good as it looks. One considered piece at a time.</p>",
        "text_font_size": 3,
        "button_1_label": "Call 1300 718 807",
